WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.339
when something goes wrong I freeze up
opposite of the ogre I freeze up I get

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:12.570
stagnant I don't want to move I just ask
myself why me I've tried saying good but

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:22.670
it's not getting me moving forward any
advice you ask yourself why me

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:33.410
so saying good that should fix your
attitude but that alone

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:41.879
that will that alone will not fix your
problems if you're having problems too

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:54.090
sure say good that's perfect but then
don't ask yourself why me instead ask

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:58.640
yourself now what am I going to do about
it

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:06.900
what are you going to do about ask
yourself that question and then figure

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:12.689
it out figure out what you're going to
do say to yourself I am going to detach

00:01:12.689 --> 00:01:18.960
I am going to assess the situation I am
going to come up with a plan and I am

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:31.890
going to execute and then start moving
it's it's not going to be a perfect plan

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:39.780
but take action action that moves you in
a positive direction and if it ends up

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:49.790
being the wrong direction that's fine at
least you've learned where not to go now

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:57.149
where this gets tough is if it is
something that seems like it's

00:01:57.149 --> 00:02:04.200
completely out of your control and you
know what some things are completely out

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.119
of your control and that's fine

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:16.780
and when that happens
you ask yourself what can I control what

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:26.400
can't I control that will make this
situation a little bit better and then

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:39.820
you go don't get crushed by things going
wrong ask yourself what am I going to do

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:45.570
and then go do it

